# sacrifices its Memnite (an artifact, but Bot2's) to its Ashnod's Altar. Neither reduces the cost: in the main phase Bot1 floats
# five mana (Mountain, Mox Ruby, Mox Jet, Sol Ring) and the spell takes all of it, {4}{R} - at {1}{R} three would be left.

